KPL/PCK

   Subset of pck00010.tpc for the Santa Monica eclipse demo: only the
   radii and IAU rotation constants for the Sun (10), Earth (399) and
   Moon (301), plus the Earth-Moon nutation/precession angles (BODY3_).
   Values were read from the pck00010.tpc kernel pool and written back
   unchanged. See pck00010.tpc for sources and documentation.

